  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Senegal RC OD</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project will focus on the 3 main sectors identified in 2016 where BRC will provide technical support on loggistics and HR and ICRC will support the finance department. Proposal has been developed by the SRC with on-going consultations and technical advice from the BRC. The result-based approach and the progressive development of the project should ensure its achievement. Due to the low-start in the planning phase and the long-lasting process of the SRC restructure BRC has clearly stated that support will be conditional to results and strong commitments of the SRC to own and lead on the project. The constitution of a monitoring committee composed of SRC executive and governance ICR and BRC advisors is a key element to guarantee progress. SR will need technical advice and support from RCM components both in developing appropriate documents to strengthen effectiveness of support services and in developing key staff capacities. All RCM actors in country have committed to support the national societies according to needs and capacities.</narrative>
  </description>
